OL,3,GNEWSALewes ready for 'absolutely
OL,4,Aelectric' Bonfire Night
OL,5,
OL,6,FLewes is ready for its renowned annual
OL,7,FBonfire Night celebration.
OL,9,FJosh Reed, who manages the White Hart
OL,10,Fpub, said the East Sussex town was
OL,11,Fgoing to be "full to the brim" on
OL,12,FThursday.
OL,14,F"It's an absolutely massive event," he
OL,15,Ftold the BBC. "We're really, really,
OL,16,Freally excited about it. It is going to
OL,17,Fbe absolutely electric."
OL,19,FThe parade sees effigies paraded
OL,20,Fthrough the town, climaxing in a huge
OL,21,Fbonfire and firework display.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
